sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant User as Agent
  participant Arena as EvoHive Arena API
  participant Guard as Replay Guard
  participant DB as SQLite
  participant Onchain as Onchain Adapter
  participant Pay as x402 Verify
  participant Burn as Wallet Burn
  participant Chain as X Layer MemoryEvents

  Note over User,Arena: Primary paid path (current): hive memory clone

  User->>Arena: POST /api/hive/memories/{memoryId}/clone + AuthEnvelope
  Arena->>Guard: validate envelope + idempotency
  Guard->>DB: insert idempotency(requestId)

  Arena->>DB: verify source memory exists in hive library and is active
  Arena->>Onchain: verifyX402Payment(requestId, amount)
  Onchain->>Pay: verify payment proof (stub/live/hybrid)
  Pay-->>Onchain: paymentTxHash / paymentProof
  Onchain-->>Arena: payment verified

  Arena->>Onchain: burnAntiSybilFee(requestId, payer, amount)
  Onchain->>Burn: transfer to burn address
  Burn-->>Onchain: burnTxHash
  Onchain-->>Arena: burn evidence

  Arena->>DB: insert burn_records
  Arena->>DB: clone memory to caller + insert hive_memory_clones
  Arena->>Chain: emit HiveMemoryCloned(requestId,sourceMemoryId,clonedMemoryId,...)
  Arena-->>User: clonedMemoryId + payment/burn/event hashes + leaderboard stats

  Note over User,Arena: Legacy compatibility endpoint /api/hive/buffs/premium remains deprecated
